                "textRuns": [
                  {
                    "value": "On schedule = Outbuild's current critical-path finish on or before the baseline (tracking) finish. The SCHEDULE pillar on the Portfolio page is NOT only this: it averages seven measures - OAC and trade partner meetings, the look-ahead, the monthly update, completion variance, submittals and RFIs - so a job 8 days ahead can still read 54% if minutes or the look-ahead are missing. The second table shows each part.",
